<speak>Hello, Claire. Yes, I am at home, in the room that is gradually becoming my study again. There are still boxes against the wall, but I have cleared the desk. I have my papers here, and I thought I would start with the personal details I have ready. My <sub alias="eff eye en">FIN</sub> is <sub alias="eff">F</sub> five six seven zero four eight eight <sub alias="ell">L</sub>. My date of birth is the thirtieth of April nineteen fifty-nine.</speak>